R\left(\alpha_{k}\middle|x\right)\equiv\mathbb{E}_{P\left(\omega\middle|x\right)}\left[\lambda\left(_{k}\middle|\omega\right)\right]=\sum_{\left\{ \omega_{j}\in\Omega\right\} }\lambda\left(\alpha_{k}\middle|\omega_{j}\right)P\left(\omega_{j}\middle|x\right)
